{"recommendationid": "187420007", "author": {"steamid": "76561199097139177", "personaname": "stauk3000", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199097139177/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 67409, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 50733, "last_played": 1784350796, "avatar": "04105de2f40534371b23d248849fa19643079081"}, "language": "english", "review": "in my opinion this game has a very unique and enjoyable play stile that i haven't found in any other game. It's a self paced survival game with a twist to its story that keeps my interest piqued at all times, an I don't get that from any other game. It's fun the creatures are cute and cuddly. the difficulty can be set from relaxed to intense, and any where in between. yes I have and would recommend this game to any one to \"give it a go\". Yes it started out a little bit rough around the edges when it first began its launch and as all new games go it improves with each and every new update. I think that the Developers of this game have truly hit the mark when it comes to fun for me.", "timestamp_created": 1738971146, "timestamp_updated": 1738971146, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1705651175", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "187418123", "author": {"steamid": "76561199087610498", "personaname": "Joe", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199087610498/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 102113, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 47308, "last_played": 1776130238, "avatar": "93b96088b42a1ceb964abea88dd5297ff66cc4c6"}, "language": "english", "review": "very entertaining", "timestamp_created": 1738969184, "tim